# Measured against this engine (Docker 29.7.2, BuildKit) while closing audit M10f: a pattern
# here matches from the context root and `*` does not cross `/`, so `.env`, `*.pem` and
# `secrets/` exclude only the top level - a nested `sub/.env` or `sub/secrets/jwt_private.pem`
# was copied into the image regardless. Every secret- and cache-bearing pattern is therefore
# written twice, once bare and once with `**/`. Do not delete the `**/` lines as duplicates.
#
# Version control
.git
.gitignore

# Environment files
.env
.env.*
.env.local
.env.*.local
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Secrets and keys
secrets/
*.pem
*.key
**/secrets/
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# Dependencies
node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# Build outputs
.next/
dist/
build/
**/dist/
**/build/

# Python artifacts
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
*.egg-info
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]

# Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/
**/.venv/
**/venv/

# Test and cache directories
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/

# Logs
*.log
**/*.log

# OS-generated files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# IDE and editor files
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# Documentation and non-essential files
Project-docs/
monitoring/
infra/terraform/
**/README.md
**/README.txt
**/*.md
